OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA day of variable cloud and
OL,6,Fbright spells with more frequent
OL,7,Fshowers, some on the heavy side, best
OL,8,Fof the sunnier spells towards Dundee
OL,9,Fand Fife. Strong westerly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FVariable cloud with a few
OL,12,Fshowers towards Deeside at first.
OL,13,FOtherwise dry with increasingly clear
OL,14,Fspells developing through the evening
OL,15,Fand overnight.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FAfter a quite chilly start in
OL,18,Fplaces it will be a dry day with
OL,19,Fbright or sunny spells and light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
