OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FCloudier Monday with patchy rain.
OL,7,FEarly rain clearing on Tuesday then
OL,8,Fsunshine and showers, windy at times.
OL,9,FWindy on Wednesday with bright spells,
OL,10,Fvariable cloud and some outbreaks of
OL,11,Frain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
